{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t今年是解放軍空軍成立77周年，吉林長春舉辦多項表演活動慶祝。其中空軍航空大學的「紅鷹」飛行表演隊，飛越當地首個航空主題城市公園「藍天公園」，長春國際航空博覽城亦舉行無人機編隊燈光表演秀。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T12:03:12.009994+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T11:42:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:17:18.353901+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:57:10.610348+00:00","content_hash":"d914b32622a9946a66e6e7d9c07d2929046c24acabbe544eb19c0c76f9cbd08f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}